WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.466
Who is in the shadows?

00:00:01.466 --> 00:00:02.640
Look at that shape.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.227
Tall back.

00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:03.814
Tiny mouth.

00:00:03.814 --> 00:00:05.574
Those fins almost touch the light.

00:00:05.574 --> 00:00:06.454
Got a guess?

00:00:06.454 --> 00:00:07.041
Keep it.

00:00:07.041 --> 00:00:08.215
Here comes another pass.

00:00:08.215 --> 00:00:08.801
Still hiding.

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:09.975
Come on, turn around.

00:00:09.975 --> 00:00:11.149
The light slides over.

00:00:11.149 --> 00:00:12.322
There is the silver.

00:00:12.322 --> 00:00:13.496
It is a permit!

00:00:13.496 --> 00:00:14.083
And look!

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:15.549
It brought the whole crew.
